**3. Create a vector of the standard deviation of the five test scores for each student in the sample.**

```{r}

# Creating a vector of the SD of the five test scores for each student.

student_sd <- apply(HSB2[, c("read", "write", "math", "science", "socst")], 1, sd)

# Display results.

student_sd


```


